N('Hangi cümle doğru?','Despite the rain, we went out.','despite + isim; of eklenmez.',{'Although the rain, we went out.':'although + özne + fiil ister.','Despite of the rain, we went out.':'despite of diye kalıp yoktur (in spite of denir).'}),
N('Hangi cümle doğru?','Although it was raining, we went out.','Tam cümle (özne + fiil) → although.',{'Despite it was raining, we went out.':'despite + isim/-ing ister, cümle gelmez.','In spite of it was raining, we went out.':'in spite of + isim/-ing ister, cümle gelmez.'}),
N('"Although he was ill, he came." Aynı anlam hangisi?','Despite being ill, he came.','despite + -ing: cümleyi isim grubuna çevirir.',{'Despite he was ill, he came.':'despite + cümle olmaz.','Despite of being ill, he came.':'despite of olmaz.'}),
N('Hangi cümle doğru?','I came here to learn English.','Amaç: to + yalın fiil.',{'I came here for learn English.':'for + yalın fiil olmaz.','I came here for to learn English.':'for to birlikte kullanılmaz.'}),
N('Hangi cümle doğru?','The hotel was nice. However, the food was bad.','however yeni cümle başında, virgülle.',{'The hotel was nice, however the food was bad.':'Noktalama: however\'den önce nokta gerekir.','The hotel was nice however, the food was bad.':'however cümle başında kullanılır.'}),
